        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b0a081a-170a-4a62-a35a-8434279e1509).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. We have a relatively simple contract for you in the coastal paradise of Sapienza. The sorbettiere Michele Inversini is going into retirement tommorow, and is going to make the recipe for his homemade gelato public. Our client has decided to take drastic measures to keep the family recipe a secret, and put out a hit. The client has an alibi set up and doesn&apos;t care how the job is done. Do make sure to try the ice cream 47, I hear it&apos;s to die for.",
